+## Keys and roles
+
+Every request sends an API key:
+
+    Authorization: Bearer <key>
+
+Keys are kept in the data file's `apiKeys` as `{ key, name, role }`. A
+request without a key, or with a key that is not there, gets 401
+`unauthorized`. A known key whose role may not use the route gets 403
+`forbidden`.
+
+| Role      | May use                                                     |
+|-----------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
+| `viewer`  | every GET route except `GET /audit`                         |
+| `cook`    | what a viewer may, plus the cook routes below               |
+| `manager` | every route                                                 |
+
+Routes and who may use them:
+
+- Any role: `GET /items`, `GET /items/:id`, `GET /batches`,
+  `GET /batches/:id`, `GET /orders/:id`, `GET /reports/stock-value`,
+  `GET /reports/waste`, `GET /alerts`, `GET /suppliers`,
+  `GET /suppliers/:id/prices`, `GET /items/:id/best-price`, `GET /dishes`,
+  `GET /reports/margins`, `GET /recipes/:id/cost`,
+  `GET /forecast/use/:itemId`, `GET /forecast/reorder`, `GET /outbox`,
+  `GET /recipes/:id/allergens`, `GET /reports/allergens`,
+  `GET /reports/temperatures`, `GET /export/ledger.csv`,
+  `GET /export/stock.csv`.
+- `cook` and `manager`: `POST /recipes/:id/cook`, `POST /batches/:id/waste`,
+  `POST /temperatures`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/counts`.
+- `manager` only: `POST /orders`, `POST /orders/:id/send`,
+  `POST /orders/:id/receive`, `POST /orders/:id/cancel`, `POST /prices`,
+  `POST /dishes`, `POST /outbox/:id/sent`, `POST /import/items`,
+  `POST /jobs/nightly`, `POST /stocktakes`, `POST /stocktakes/:id/finish`,
+  `PUT /items/:id/allergens`, `GET /audit`.
+
+## Audit
+
+Every request that may change data (any method but GET/HEAD/OPTIONS) made
+with a known key is recorded, including refused and failed ones, as
+
+    { "at": "2026-10-28T10:00:00.000Z", "keyName": "head chef",
+      "method": "POST", "path": "/prices", "status": 201 }
+
+`GET /audit` (managers only) lists the entries newest first.

